      "writtenOn": "2024-04-26T07:45:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, it looks like those raw statistics do provide access to the raw data, so I could probably copy it out from those custom-statistic callbacks, even if it doesn\u0027t look like that\u0027s how they are intended to be used.\n\nI want to be able to plot a histogram or CDF over the latencies, and that requires the raw data. I\u0027ve found that they provide a lot insight that just the 50%, 90%, 99% percentiles don\u0027t give me.",
      "parentUuid": "38f6c9d4_5836bf85",
      "revId": "7a29e26f070c167bb851045b90ca74423d27ee1f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
